From: SBE core-userland compatibility build
Subject: iwinfo: target the factory libiwinfo 20181126 ABI

The locked rpcd source grew in step with newer libiwinfo structures.  The
factory QSDK ABI is libiwinfo20181126 and must not be replaced along with the
management daemon.  Retain the 2020 field layout and JSON contract, plus the
2021 object-type rename and the 2026 survey cleanup/error-path fix.  This is a
source-level compatibility reduction only; file.c and all other rpcd security
fixes remain at e37ed9d8.

